    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d12">

                <pb facs="0126" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg6"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Diplomatic
                        Officers of the United States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-01"><hi rendition="#italic">July 1,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Secretary Hay died unexpectedly at 12.25 this morning. Notify government and
                    display usual symbols of mourning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Peirce</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
